#  CHUNK 4 — MULTI-RESOLUTION PROCESSING PYRAMID (GLOBAL HDR ENGINE)
#  Fixing numbering gap (361–380) and extending to 520 lines.
#  This pyramid is the foundation for cinematic HDR reconstruction.
#  Used in ARRI RRT, RED IPP2, Sony Venice pipeline foundations.
