# CHUNK 79 D — Ultra Tonal Depth Engine V3
#
# Purpose:
#   • Rebuilds micro-density in shadows without crushing them
#   • Adds film-like tonal separation in low/mid tones
#   • Prevents muddy blacks after heavy grading (bloom/halation/etc.)
#   • Simulates subtle density curve of Kodak Vision3 / ARRI LogC
#   • Protects highlight ratios and skin tones
#
# Best placed BEFORE:
#   – Film grain
#   – Final LUT (ACES/Show LUT)
#
# Best placed AFTER:
