# CHUNK 80 A — NEURAL CINEMATIC LUT MAPPER V5
#
# PURPOSE:
#   • Merge Technical LUT + Creative LUT + Neural LUT
#   • Auto-select LUT blend based on scene-key / highlight ratio
#   • Maintain ACES stability + preserve skin tone vectors
#   • Temporal smoothing prevents flicker between frames
