# CHUNK 81B — FILM STOCK PRESET ENGINE V5 (Kodak / Fuji / CineStill)
# ==============================================================================
# Provides real-scanned film stock personality profiles:
#
# Included stocks:
#   • Kodak Vision3 50D (5203)
#   • Kodak Vision3 250D (5207)
#   • Kodak Vision3 500T (5219)
#   • Kodak Vision Print Film 2383 (Positive)
