# CHUNK 81O — ULTRA ANAMORPHIC BOKEH STREAKS + CYLINDER OPTICS ENGINE V4
# ==============================================================================
# Simulates optical artifacts produced by anamorphic glass:
#   • Horizontal streak flares (blue / gold)
#   • Cylinder-lens stretch deformation (squeeze factor)
#   • Oval bokeh (aspect > 1)
#   • Edge smear + directional aberration
#   • CoC-modulated streak intensity
#   • Chromatic streak separation
#
# Placement in pipeline:
#   AFTER 81N (Focus Bloom + Bokeh Expansion)
#   BEFORE Halation / Final Film LUT
