# CHUNK 81Q-B — HALATION EDGE-PRESERVATION + ANTI-MUDDYING ENGINE V6.2
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Halation adds glow & film realism—but it can:
#     • soften edges too much
#     • introduce magenta/pink color drift
#     • reduce local micro-contrast
#     • smear highlight shapes
#
# This engine fixes those issues:
#   • Edge-guided halation suppression
#   • Cross-chroma stabilization (anti-magenta shift)
