# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 81Q-Z-AE — MASTER OUTPUT ENCODER ENGINE V3
# ==============================================================================
# Handles final delivery formatting:
#   • ACEScg → ACES2065-1 → chosen output container
#   • EXR 16F / 32F writer (lossless, float)
#   • TIFF 16-bit writer (integer pipeline)
#   • ProRes-like mezzanine encoder (placeholder, intra-frame)
#   • H.264 / H.265 legal-range encoding
#   • Metadata embed: LUT name, pipeline version, lens model
#
# Placement:
#   AFTER 81Q-Z-AD (Display Legalizer)
#   Final step before file export.
