# CHUNK 81Q-Z-C5 — FILM STOCK COMPRESSION LUT ENGINE V9
# ==============================================================================
# Emulates real film stock response curves:
#   • Toe compression (shadows soften, detail preserved)
#   • Mid-tone shaping (cinematic contrast distribution)
#   • Shoulder rolloff (highlights compress gracefully)
#   • Channel-specific curves (R, G, B differ like real film)
#   • Color density compression → saturation shift
#   • Printer-lights exposure model (12-point density scale)
#   • ACES-safe output
#
# Purpose:
#   To unify the image after all chemical/optical effects and
#   shape it into a proper "film stock" response.
#
# Placement in pipeline:
#   AFTER 81Q-Z-C4 (Chemical Halo Bloom V7)
#   BEFORE 81Q-Z-C6 (Spectral Color Matrix V5)
