# CHUNK 81Q-Z-C9 — SPECTRAL BLOOM ENGINE V7
# ==============================================================================
# This engine produces physically-faithful film bloom using:
#
#   ✔ Spectral weighting (R strongest, G medium, B weakest)
#   ✔ Multi-kernel pyramid (6 radii)
#   ✔ Highlight-adaptive glow width
#   ✔ Energy-preserving ACES blend
#   ✔ Warm lens coating bias (optional)
