#   ✔ Edge-preserving softness (avoids mushy digital blur)
#   ✔ Micro veiling-glare (adds atmospheric softness)
#   ✔ Intensity-adaptive diffusion (brighter → softer)
#   ✔ Spectral separation (R diffuses slightly more than B)
#
# Goal:
#   Produce film-lens softness similar to:
#       • Tiffen Black Pro-Mist
#       • Schneider Hollywood Black Magic
