# Purpose:
#   Recreate authentic film halation resulting from:
#       • Emulsion layer penetration
#       • Backscatter through anti-halation layer failure
#       • Red-layer dominated spectral bloom
#       • Highlight-only triggered diffusion
#
# Technical Features V6:
#   ✔ Multi-band blur (3 radii) blended by wavelength bias
#   ✔ Highlight extraction using soft-knee threshold
#   ✔ Red-channel weighted scattering (physical)
#   ✔ Edge-aware weighting for directional lenses (anamorphic option)
#   ✔ ACES-safe hue preservation so highlight bloom never pollutes skin tones
#
# Pipeline placement:
#   AFTER: 81Q-Z-C17 (Filmic Contrast V6)
#   BEFORE: 81Q-Z-C19 (Film Grain V9)
