# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 81 Q Z C49 — ULTRA ANALOG FILM STOCK “HARMONIC LUMINANCE BREATHING”
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Real films *breathe* in brightness due to:
#       • chemical transport micro-delay per frame,
#       • varying micro-thickness of emulsion layers,
#       • analog enlarger light decay curves,
#       • gate-pressure fluctuations affecting exposure.
#
#   This module simulates **frame-to-frame luminance breathing** found in
#   35mm, 70mm, and IMAX negative stocks.
#
# Features:
#   • Multi-band exposure flutter (0.1–2.5 Hz)
#   • Log-encoded breathing (film exposure = log space)
#   • Adaptive breathing based on local contrast
#   • Halation-aware modulation (prevents glow pulsing)
#   • ACES-safe
#
# Pipeline Position:
#     AFTER: LabChemicalFlicker (80Z-Z)
#     BEFORE: Film Spectral Profiles (81A…)
