#                     ENERGY DISSIPATION MODEL V1”
# ==============================================================================
# Real film does NOT keep grain energy constant — bright regions cause:
#     • cluster over-exposure → energy bleed into neighboring grains
#     • adjacency energy compression → local contrast tightening
