# Purpose:
#   • Extract native GoPro Hero 12 gyro via GPMF metadata
#   • Convert to full-motion vectors (pitch, yaw, roll)
#   • Compute confidence + latency metadata
#   • Align GoPro IMU with drone-body MPU6050 (center PCB)
#   • Output stabilization-grade motion packets
