# CHUNK 81 L 13 — FILM STOCK MEMORY BIAS (PERCEPTUAL-ADAPTIVE)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Simulate long-term perceptual memory bias embedded in film stocks,
#   where repeated exposure, lab practices, and cultural grading trends
