# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 81 M 01 — PERCEPTUAL SAFEGUARD CORE (ULTRA)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Enforce human-vision-consistent perceptual bounds to prevent
#   AI over-processing artifacts (hyper-contrast, neon chroma,
