# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 81 N 08 — DUAL-CAMERA METADATA FUSION & TRUST ARBITRATION (ULTRA)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Fuse GoPro GPMF gyro metadata with internal IMU motion data to produce
