# CHUNK 81P-03 — HIGHLIGHT HUE STABILITY & CHROMA COHERENCE MODEL
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Maintain hue stability and chroma coherence under extreme highlight stress.
#   Prevents digital hue skews (yellow/magenta flips) while preserving film-like
#   color separation and perceptual saturation in bright regions.
