# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 81P-05 — CHROMA-LUMA DECOUPLED HIGHLIGHT SATURATION CONTROL
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Prevent highlight saturation collapse while avoiding digital oversaturation.
#   This model decouples chroma from luminance specifically in high-energy regions,
#   allowing highlights to retain believable color density without hue skew.
