# Cinematic Intent:
#   - Film highlights retain chroma longer than digital sensors
#   - Saturation should taper perceptually, not mathematically
#   - Hue integrity must be preserved under extreme exposure
#
# References:
#   - Kodak Vision3 color dye density behavior
#   - ARRI Alexa highlight chroma retention
#   - ACES perceptual rendering research
