# CHUNK 82 M 04 — MULTI-SHOT DENSITY CONTINUITY
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Maintain coherent density progression across multiple shots within
#   the same narrative or take, preventing density resets that feel digital.
#
# Film principle:
#   In real film workflows, shots captured within the same roll or lighting
#   setup exhibit continuity of density despite edits and camera moves.
#
# Visible impact:
#   - Smooth density continuity across cut sequences
#   - Prevents "digital reset" look between related shots
#   - Enhances cinematic flow in montage editing
#
# Runs AFTER:
