# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Prevent long-term unintended density drift caused by cumulative
#   rounding, temporal bias, or multi-system feedback interactions.
#
# Film principle:
#   Photochemical film exhibits equilibrium behavior — density stabilizes
#   unless deliberately pushed by exposure or development changes.
#
# Visible impact:
#   - Eliminates slow “boiling” density artifacts
#   - Maintains stable midtones over long takes
#   - Preserves grading predictability
#
# Runs AFTER:
