# CHUNK 82 M 07 — COLOR-DENSITY MEMORY ACROSS CUTS
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Preserve coherent color-density relationships across editorial cuts
#   without bleeding full-frame memory. Maintains perceived continuity
#   while respecting new scene context.
#
# Film principle:
#   Color and density coupling in film persists across adjacent cuts due
#   to lab timing continuity, but resets selectively rather than globally.
#
# Visible impact:
#   - Prevents color-density popping at cuts
#   - Maintains chromatic intent through edits
#   - Avoids ghosting from previous scenes
#
# Runs AFTER:
