#   Sudden per-frame color timing shifts do not occur in real film workflows.
#
# Visible impact:
#   - Eliminates RGB timing flicker
#   - Maintains shot-to-shot color continuity
#   - Preserves cinematic cohesion
#
# Runs AFTER:
