# ==============================================================================
# CHUNK 82 P 05 — COLOR TIMING SECTION FINALIZATION
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Lock all printer-light and dye-interaction color timing decisions into a
#   stable, deterministic state before saturation shaping and creative grading.
#
# Film principle:
#   In photochemical workflows, once printer lights and inter-layer dye effects
