# CHUNK 82 U 03 — SHADOW TEMPORAL STABILITY
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Stabilize shadow behavior over time to prevent low-end flicker,
#   crawling noise, or pumping caused by motion and exposure variation.
#
# Film principle:
