# CHUNK 85 Y 07 — CINEMATIC INTENT CONFLICT RESOLUTION
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Resolve conflicts between competing cinematic intents coming from
#   different AI subsystems:
#     - Shot grammar
#     - Narrative continuity
#     - Rhythm & pacing
