# Purpose:
#   Merge autonomous cinematic AI decisions with live human intent
#   (app input, joystick bias, chat commands) in a film-director-safe way.
#
#   This ensures:
#     - AI remains primary by default
#     - Human input can bias or override gracefully
#     - No sudden “fight” between AI and operator
