# CHUNK 85 Z 02 — CAMERA AI STATE MACHINE
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Formalize camera-AI behavior into explicit states with
#   hysteresis, confidence gating, and temporal smoothing.
#
#   Ensures:
#     - Predictable cinematic transitions
#     - No rapid state flipping
#     - Robust behavior across lighting & motion extremes
#
#   Scope:
#     Camera AI only (exposure, focus, framing, stabilization intent).
#
