# CHUNK 86 L 02 — GRAMMAR-DRIVEN CAMERA CONSTRAINTS
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Translate shot grammar into concrete camera motion constraints.
#
# Cinematic principle:
#   Camera movement must obey shot grammar,
#   not the other way around.
