# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Orchestrate safe, ethical, and recoverable landings under
#   normal, degraded, or emergency conditions by fusing terrain,
#   perception confidence, power margins, and public safety context.
#
# Backbone truth:
#   A mission is only complete when it ends safely.
#
