# CHUNK 86 Y 03 — FLEET-WIDE INCIDENT INTELLIGENCE LAYER
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Transform incidents, near-misses, and anomalies from individual
#   drones into shared fleet intelligence, enabling predictive
#   avoidance, adaptive policy updates, and collective learning.
