# CHUNK 86 AG 01 — MANUAL CONTROL INJECTION & BLENDING LAYER
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Safely inject human manual control signals (sticks, sliders,
#   gestures) into the autonomous control pipeline using intent-aware,
#   temporally-smooth blending rather than abrupt authority seizure.
#
# Backbone truth:
#   Manual control should feel like guidance, not collision.
