# CHUNK 86 AI 01 — DETERMINISTIC CONTROL PACKET SCHEDULER
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Enforce deterministic timing, ordering, and survivability of
#   control packets sent toward the flight controller, guaranteeing
#   stable control loops under jitter, latency, and partial packet loss.
#
# Backbone truth:
#   Stability is timing discipline.
