# CHUNK 86 AR 01 — GRACEFUL MISSION TERMINATION ORCHESTRATOR
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Orchestrate safe, intention-aware mission termination sequences
#   (land, loiter, return, hold) that preserve vehicle stability,
#   human trust, and narrative dignity after abort or completion.
