# CHUNK 86 BO 01 — CRUISE STABILITY & ENERGY OPTIMIZER
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Optimize cruise-phase stability, energy consumption, and control
#   smoothness while preserving cinematic motion quality and emotional
#   continuity over long-duration flight.
#
# Backbone truth:
#   Effortless flight is engineered, not accidental.
#
