# CHUNK 90 A 01 — DIRECTOR ↔ CLOUD AI SYNCHRONIZATION
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Synchronize on-drone Director AI with cloud intelligence
#   to enable higher-level reasoning, memory consolidation,
#   and strategic guidance — without introducing latency,
#   authority inversion, or single-point dependency.
