# CHUNK 91 C 01 — LIVE OPERATOR OVERRIDE ARBITRATION
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Arbitrate live human operator intervention against autonomous
#   Director AI control — deciding when overrides are permitted,
#   how much authority is granted, and how control is released
#   without destabilizing flight, camera intent, or safety systems.
#
# Core principle:
