#
# Purpose:
#   Synchronize backbone-level state, Director cognition summaries,
#   and mission telemetry with cloud infrastructure in a bandwidth-
#   efficient, latency-tolerant, autonomy-preserving manner.
#
# Core principle:
#   The cloud observes, advises, and remembers —
#   it never pilots in real time.
