# CHUNK 94 B 01 — CLOUD AI ↔ MISSION-LEVEL GUIDANCE
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Exchange mission-scale guidance between cloud AI and the
#   onboard Director/Backbone system — focusing on objectives,
#   constraints, and narrative intent rather than control signals.
#
# Core principle:
#   The cloud proposes *why and where* —
#   the drone decides *how and when*.
