# CHUNK 137 A 01 — SHOT INTEGRITY MONITOR
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Continuously monitor shot integrity across framing, motion,
#   emotion, and perceptual confidence — detecting degradation
#   early enough for the Director to intervene gracefully.
#
# Core principle:
