# CHUNK 142 A 01 — CROSS-MISSION LEARNING INTEGRATOR
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Integrate learning signals across missions, environments, and
#   platforms — consolidating episodic outcomes into durable,
#   bias-aware intelligence without catastrophic forgetting.
#
# Core principle:
