# CHUNK 143 A 01 — CLOUD ↔ ONBOARD PREFERENCE SYNC
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Synchronize stylistic preferences and learned constraints
#   between cloud intelligence and onboard Director AI —
#   preserving autonomy, minimizing latency artifacts, and
#   preventing preference drift.
#
# Core principle:
